<title>JAPAN: Sumikura Industrial - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Sumikura Industrial - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  2.19		vs	    2.10</p>
<p> Operating   loss 360    million	  vs   loss 559    million</p>
<p> Current     loss 350    million	  vs   loss 551    million</p>
<p> Net	   loss 359    million	  vs   loss 840    million</p>
<p> EPS	    loss 18.94 yen	  vs    loss 44.21 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     19 million	  vs	  19 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Sumikura Industrial Co Ltd is an industrial machinery maker.</p>
</text>
